---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Grab Scanner" description="A private household tool that summarises Grab receipts." noindex>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-10 sm:px-10 sm:py-14">
    <div class="prose-body">
      <h1>Grab Scanner</h1>
      <p>
        Grab Scanner is a small private tool I wrote for my own household. It reads the Grab e-receipts
        (rides, GrabFood and GrabMart) in the Gmail accounts of family members who have chosen to connect,
        and turns them into a spending summary that only we can see.
      </p>
      <p>
        It is not a public service: only a handful of named Google accounts can sign in. It runs on my own
        computer and asks Google for read-only access.
      </p>
      <p>
        See the <a href="/grab-scanner/privacy">privacy policy</a> for exactly what data it touches and what
        happens to it.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
